// expect: same: ID,DX,PCT = 1|NULL|44.5783;2|-13|42.1052;3|-13|35.4838;4|37|100;5|-13|100;6|-13|100;7|-13|100;8|37|55.4216;9|-13|57.8947;10|-13|64.5161
// expect: same: ID,RN,MG = 1|1|5;2|2|5;3|3|5
